    <detaileddescription>
<para>The type of the context passed to <ref refid="group__psa__external__rng_1ga54bf8b06d11637bf8ee07629760efb9a" kindref="member">mbedtls_psa_external_get_random()</ref>.</para><para>Mbed TLS initializes the context to all-bits-zero before calling <ref refid="group__psa__external__rng_1ga54bf8b06d11637bf8ee07629760efb9a" kindref="member">mbedtls_psa_external_get_random()</ref> for the first time.</para><para>The definition of this type in the Mbed TLS source code is for demonstration purposes. Implementers of <ref refid="group__psa__external__rng_1ga54bf8b06d11637bf8ee07629760efb9a" kindref="member">mbedtls_psa_external_get_random()</ref> are expected to replace it with a custom definition. </para>    </detaileddescription>
